  "id": "73468a27-34e1-4033-81f7-ec0dffa3940c",
  "title": "Unified Framework for Medical Image Segmentation with Uncertainty-Aware Techniques",
  "summary": "SegWithU introduces a post-hoc framework that augments a frozen segmentation backbone with a lightweight uncertainty head, modeling uncertainty as perturbation energy in a compact probe space. It achieves state-of-the-art performance across multiple benchmark datasets, demonstrating robustness and efficiency in reliability-aware medical segmentation. This report builds upon previous advancements in medical imaging and diffusion techniques, with SegWithU addressing the challenges of uncertainty and reliability in medical segmentation.",
